  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cities4Forests</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cities4Forests is a movement to catalyze political, social, and economic support among city governments and urban citizens to integrate the inner, nearby, and faraway forests into city development plans and programs, and to introduce the new voices of mayors and urban citizens in support of sustaining forests. The Norwegian grant supports cities in developing countries and reduction of tropical deforestation.</narrative>
  </description>
